{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Factorised bras annihilated by the LR difference\n\n**Question (Paul).** Bras with ⟨B|(t̄₁(u) − t̄₃(u+h)) = 0 for all u certainly exist (span of left eigenvectors of LR-symmetric states). Does that space contain a **product state** ⊗_s v_s other than the trivial BPS ones? (In 2603 the BPS bra ⟨W| at ω = 1 is such a product state, non-trivially, at finite twist.)\n\n**L = 2 pairs, exact.** X(u) = t̄₁(u) − t̄₃(u+h) at the ABJM point (θ_A = 2h, θ_F = 0), coefficient matrices X_k exact; left kernel 𝒦 = {b : b·X_k = 0 ∀k} (bilinear pairing, as for the bridges). Product-state search: minimise f(v) = ‖b − P_𝒦 b‖²/‖b‖² over b = v₁⊗v₂⊗v₃⊗v₄, many random starts; classify the zeros (eigen-bra of t̄₁? which multiplets does it couple to?). Then the twisted chain with z₁z₄ = z₂z₃.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ee, rho, siteOpL, lax1, lax3, mono, transferM];\nnn = 4; hh = 1/2;\nee[i_, j_] := SparseArray[{{i, j}} -> 1, {nn, nn}];\nrho[\"A\"][i_, j_] := ee[i, j]; rho[\"F\"][i_, j_] := -ee[j, i];\nid4 = IdentityMatrix[nn, SparseArray];\nsiteOpL[s_, m_, L_] := KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[b == s, m, id4], {b, L}];\nlax1[ty_][v_, t_][i_, j_] := (v - t) KroneckerDelta[i, j] id4 + hh rho[ty][i, j];\nlax3[\"A\"][v_, t_][k_, l_] := (v - t + hh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] id4 - hh ee[l, k];\nlax3[\"F\"][v_, t_][k_, l_] := (v - t - 3 hh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] id4 + hh ee[k, l];\nmono[lax_, types_, ths_, v_] := Module[{L = Length[types], T},\n   T = Table[siteOpL[1, lax[types[[1]]][v, ths[[1]]][i, j], L], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\n   Do[T = Table[Sum[T[[i, k]] . siteOpL[s, lax[types[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][k, j], L], {k, nn}], {i, nn}, {j, nn}], {s, 2, L}]; T];\n(* twisted transfer matrices: t1 with twist Lam, t3 with twist det(Lam) Lam^-T (Lam diagonal here) *)\ntransferM[lax_, types_, ths_, v_, G_] := With[{T = mono[lax, types, ths, v]}, Sum[T[[i, j]] G[[j, i]], {i, nn}, {j, nn}]];\ntypes4 = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}; thAB4 = {2 hh, 0, 2 hh, 0};\nClear[u];\nXu = Normal[transferM[lax1, types4, thAB4, u, IdentityMatrix[nn]] - transferM[lax3, types4, thAB4, u + hh, IdentityMatrix[nn]]];\ndegX = Max[Exponent[Flatten[Xu], u]];\nXk = Table[Coefficient[Xu, u, k], {k, 0, degX}];\nKb = NullSpace[Join @@ (Transpose /@ Xk)];\nvac = Flatten[Outer[Times, UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4]]];\nGrid[{{\"deg_u X\", degX}, {\"dim of left kernel 𝒦 (of 256)\", Length[Kb]}, {\"vacuum bra in 𝒦\", MatrixRank[Append[Kb, vac]] == Length[Kb]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"67\" data-out-n=\"670\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[670]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkZWdcX3UgWH0gJiAxXFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gb2YgbGVmdCBrZXJuZWwgJFxtYXRoY2Fse0t9JCAob2YgMjU2KX0gJiAxMzZcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3ZhY3V1bSBicmEgaW4gJFxtYXRoY2Fse0t9JH0gJiBcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg_u X</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim of left kernel </span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.01445em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\"> (of 256)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacuum bra in </span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.01445em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">136</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[670]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{deg\\_u X} & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{dim of left kernel $\\mathcal{K}$ (of 256)} & 136\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum bra in $\\mathcal{K}$} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "53942764-e87c-4d86-8002-27c94d90ba3e"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** X(u) is only linear in u at L = 2 (the higher charges of t̄₁ and t̄₃(u+h) agree); dim 𝒦 = 136 of 256; the vacuum bra lies in 𝒦.\n\n### Product-state search (untwisted)\n\nf(v) = 1 − ‖P_𝒦 b‖²/‖b‖², b = v₁⊗⋯⊗v₄ (v_s ∈ ℂ⁴), FindMinimum from 40 random starts. For each zero (f < 10⁻¹⁰): eigen-bra residual of t̄₁, and which saved L = 2 multiplets it couples to (random global rotations).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Kon = Orthogonalize[N[Kb]];\nprodVec[x_List] := Module[{c = x[[1 ;; 16]] + I x[[17 ;; 32]]}, Flatten[Outer[Times, Sequence @@ Partition[c, 4]]]];\nfK[x_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &)] := Module[{b = prodVec[x]}, 1 - Total[Abs[Conjugate[Kon] . b]^2]/Norm[b]^2];\nT1n = N[transferM[lax1, types4, thAB4, 0.37, IdentityMatrix[nn]]];\nstates = Import[\"c:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\data\\\\abjm-hw-states.wxf\", \"WXF\"];\nSeedRandom[11]; gs = Table[RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, {4, 4}], 4];\nrotBra[b_, g_] := Module[{t = ArrayReshape[b, {4, 4, 4, 4}], gi = Transpose[Inverse[g]]},\n   Flatten[TensorContract[TensorProduct[g, gi, g, gi, t], {{2, 9}, {4, 10}, {6, 11}, {8, 12}}]]];\ncouples[b_] := Select[Table[{st[\"dyn\"], Round[st[\"E\"], 0.001], st[\"LR\"] < 10^-8, Max[Abs[(rotBra[b, #] . Normal[st[\"psi\"]]) & /@ gs]]}, {st, states[\"L2\"]}], #[[4]] > 10^-8 &][[All, 1 ;; 3]];\nSeedRandom[3];\nruns = Table[Module[{x0 = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 32], sol, xs},\n    sol = Quiet[FindMinimum[fK[xs], {xs, x0}, Method -> \"QuasiNewton\", MaxIterations -> 2000]];\n    {sol[[1]], xs /. sol[[2]]}], {40}];\nzeros = Select[runs, #[[1]] < 10^-10 &];\nzeroInfo = Table[Module[{b = prodVec[z[[2]]], lam}, b = b/Norm[b]; lam = (b . T1n . Conjugate[b]);\n    {ScientificForm[z[[1]], 2], ScientificForm[Norm[b . T1n - lam b], 2], couples[b]}], {z, zeros}];\nGrid[{{\"# starts\", Length[runs]}, {\"minimal values f (sorted, first 10)\", ScientificForm[#, 2] & /@ Take[Sort[runs[[All, 1]]], UpTo[10]]}, {\"# zeros (f < 10⁻¹⁰)\", Length[zeros]},\n  {\"zeros: {f, eigen-bra residual of t̄₁, coupled multiplets {Dynkin, E, LR}}\", Grid[zeroInfo, Frame -> All]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"68\" data-out-n=\"683\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[683]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div data-wolfram-is-skeleton=\"1\" data-wolfram-atom-count=\"1004\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:111.8405em;vertical-align:-55.6502em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:56.1902em;\"><span style=\"top:-58.1502em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:58.1502em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:111.8005em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-55.6502em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:56.1502em;\"><span style=\"top:-111.6755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># starts</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-110.4655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minimal values f (sorted, first 10)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-109.2655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># zeros (f &lt; 10⁻¹⁰)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-54.5402em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">zeros: {f, eigen-bra residual of </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">₁, coupled multiplets {Dynkin, E, LR}}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:55.6502em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:111.8005em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-55.6502em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:56.1502em;\"><span style=\"top:-111.6755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-110.4655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:56.3652em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-16</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3.3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mti