  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (untwisted, L = 2):** all 40 starts converge to f ≈ 0, and every zero is exactly a globally rotated vacuum (v₁ ∥ v₃, v₂ ∥ v₄, all A·F pairings 0) — the trivial BPS orbit. (The apparent couplings to the adjoint pair were 10⁻⁹ noise: f is a squared distance.) **Untwisted, no non-trivial factorised bra.**\n\n## Twisted chain, z₁z₄ = z₂z₃ = 1\n\nΛ = diag(z₁, z₂, 1/z₂, 1/z₁) (exact, z₁ = 3/2, z₂ = 5/4); the fused t₃ of the same chain has twist detΛ·Λ⁻¹ = diag(z₄, z₃, z₂, z₁), the Weyl image of Λ. (1) LR-symmetric states exist? (2) Left kernel 𝒦^Λ of X^Λ(u) = t̄₁^Λ(u) − t̄₃^{Λ̃}(u+h). (3) Is the note's ⟨W_a^L| = ((e₁+ae₄)⊗(e₄−ae₁))^⊗2 in 𝒦^Λ for some a? (4) Product-state search in 𝒦^Λ and classification of the zeros (eigen-bra or not).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "z1 = 3/2; z2 = 5/4; Lam = DiagonalMatrix[{z1, z2, 1/z2, 1/z1}]; LamT = Det[Lam] Inverse[Lam];\nT1L[v_] := transferM[lax1, types4, thAB4, v, Lam]; T3L[v_] := transferM[lax3, types4, thAB4, v, LamT];\n(* (1) LR-symmetric states of the twisted chain *)\nModule[{a = N[T1L[37/100]], b = N[T3L[37/100 + hh]], c = N[T1L[-61/100]], d = N[T3L[-61/100 + hh]], ev, V},\n  {ev, V} = Eigensystem[a + 0.3 c];\n  lrTw = Table[{Abs[(v . (Transpose[a] . Conjugate[v]) - v . (Transpose[b] . Conjugate[v]))], Norm[a . v - (Conjugate[v] . a . v) v]}, {v, Normalize /@ V}]];\nXuL = Normal[Expand[T1L[u] - T3L[u + hh]]]; degXL = Max[Exponent[Flatten[XuL], u]];\nXkL = Table[Coefficient[XuL, u, k], {k, 0, degXL}];\nKbL = NullSpace[Join @@ (Transpose /@ XkL)];\nClear[a]; Wa = Flatten[Outer[Times, UnitVector[4, 1] + a UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 4] - a UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 1] + a UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 4] - a UnitVector[4, 1]]];\nWaRes = Factor[Union[Flatten[Expand[(Wa . #) & /@ XkL]]]];\nWaSol = Quiet[Solve[Thread[WaRes == 0], a]];\nGrid[{{\"twisted spectrum: # eigenstates with τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(u+h) (u = 0.37)\", Count[lrTw, s_ /; s[[1]] < 10^-9]},\n  {\"deg_u X^Λ\", degXL}, {\"dim 𝒦^Λ\", Length[KbL]},\n  {\"vacuum bra in 𝒦^Λ\", MatrixRank[Append[KbL, vac]] == Length[KbL]},\n  {\"W_a·X_k^Λ = 0 solutions a\", WaSol}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"69\" data-out-n=\"693\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"12\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[693]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;$&#39;, got &#39;$̄&#39; at position 76: …ates with $\\tau$̲̲̄₁(u) = $\\tau$̄₃…<br><small>\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{twisted spectrum: \\# eigenstates with $\\tau$̄₁(u) = $\\tau$̄₃(u+h) (u = 0.37)} &amp; 36\\\\\\hline\\text{deg\\_u X\\^{}$\\Lambda$} &amp; 3\\\\\\hline\\text{dim $\\mathcal{K}$\\^{}$\\Lambda$} &amp; 36\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum bra in $\\mathcal{K}$\\^{}$\\Lambda$} &amp; \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W\\_a$\\cdot$X\\_k\\^{}$\\Lambda$ = 0 solutions a} &amp; \\left\\{\\left\\{a\\to 0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[693]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{twisted spectrum: \\# eigenstates with $\\tau$̄₁(u) = $\\tau$̄₃(u+h) (u = 0.37)} & 36\\\\\\hline\\text{deg\\_u X\\^{}$\\Lambda$} & 3\\\\\\hline\\text{dim $\\mathcal{K}$\\^{}$\\Lambda$} & 36\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum bra in $\\mathcal{K}$\\^{}$\\Lambda$} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{W\\_a$\\cdot$X\\_k\\^{}$\\Lambda$ = 0 solutions a} & \\left\\{\\left\\{a\\to 0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "b9d83eea-9b1b-4012-803e-4b136acc0779"
    }
