   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** the twisted chain (z₁z₄ = z₂z₃ = 1) has 36 LR-symmetric eigenstates (τ̄₁^Λ(u) = τ̄₃^{Λ̃}(u+h)) out of 256; dim 𝒦^Λ = 36 (their left eigenvectors); vacuum ∈ 𝒦^Λ; the note's W_a is in 𝒦^Λ only for a = 0.\n\n### Product-state search in 𝒦^Λ\n\nSame minimisation, 60 starts. Zeros are classified as eigen-bras of t̄₁^Λ (trivial) or not; for non-eigen zeros, which LR eigenstates they overlap with.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "KonL = Orthogonalize[N[KbL]];\nfKL[x_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &)] := Module[{b = prodVec[x]}, 1 - Total[Abs[Conjugate[KonL] . b]^2]/Norm[b]^2];\nT1Ln = N[T1L[37/100]];\n{evL, VL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[T1Ln + 0.3 N[T1L[-61/100]]]];  (* left eigenvectors of t1 *)\nSeedRandom[5];\nrunsL = Table[Module[{x0 = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 32], sol, xs},\n    sol = Quiet[FindMinimum[fKL[xs], {xs, x0}, Method -> \"QuasiNewton\", MaxIterations -> 3000]];\n    {sol[[1]], xs /. sol[[2]]}], {60}];\nzerosL = Select[runsL, #[[1]] < 10^-12 &];\nclassL = Table[Module[{b = Normalize[prodVec[z[[2]]]], lam, res, nOv},\n    lam = b . T1Ln . Conjugate[b]/(b . Conjugate[b]); res = Norm[b . T1Ln - lam b];\n    nOv = Count[Abs[(Normalize /@ VL) . b], s_ /; s > 10^-6];\n    {res < 10^-6, nOv, Round[Abs[Normalize[Partition[z[[2, 1 ;; 16]] + I z[[2, 17 ;; 32]], 4][[1]]]], 0.001]}], {z, zerosL}];\nGrid[{{\"# starts\", Length[runsL]}, {\"10 smallest f\", ScientificForm[#, 2] & /@ Take[Sort[runsL[[All, 1]]], UpTo[10]]}, {\"# zeros (f < 10⁻¹²)\", Length[zerosL]},\n  {\"zeros: {eigen-bra?, # left eigenvectors it overlaps (out of 256)} — tally\", Tally[classL[[All, 1 ;; 2]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"70\" data-out-n=\"702\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[702]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.05em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.295em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.865em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># starts</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">10 smallest f</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.455em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># zeros (f &lt; 10⁻¹²)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.645em;\"><span class=\"pstru